{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 885, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af81432f2ff0acf0b8816081b8", "baseline_text": "있잖아，//레니～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねぇねぇ、//レニ～！", "pointer_offset": 764, "unit": "dialogue:bdd66a70b569bcc6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 906, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf7d12f2ffb89f0d8f1438148", "baseline_text": "아이리스…//왜 그래？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アイリス……//どうかしたの？", "pointer_offset": 768, "unit": "dialogue:1f7dd4ee1ea1978a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 935, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f2e8f8a4f0b5f3eef15781432f2ff174f0aef0b9f947f0d0f0aff0b5f984f0b1f14781432f2ff46ef154f15af951fa99f16ff0af8148", "baseline_text": "왠지 오빠는，//파리에서 돌아오고 나서，//멋있어진 것 같아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なんだか、お兄ちゃんって、//巴里からかえってきて、//カッコよくなったよね？", "pointer_offset": 772, "unit": "dialogue:b5173ae9f06f1c01", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1010, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0d8f27ef0f081442f2ff369f36df8f4f2d9f0e2f243f1f3f18481432f2ff34ff39df36df8f4f2baf0a8f8c1fa99f16ff0af8144", "baseline_text": "…그렇네．//영력도 증대되었고，//통솔력도 올라간 것 같아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……そうだね。//霊力も増大しているし、//統率力もあがったようだ。", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:8c06d700ae56570e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1075, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f0b2f2628143f0b2f262f7d1", "baseline_text": "이런，이런…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "やれやれ……", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:ef5d8e64819e071c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2221, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f172f0c5f8e1f173f1edf0faf0a8f1c78143f1abf8a3f0b1f0a48144", "baseline_text": "흑발의 귀공자라면，바로 나지．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "黒髪の貴公子とは、俺のことさ。", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:bf6241be08759bdc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1119, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f1f7fad6f140f8b9f2b2f39bf0a5f9c7f991f26781b8", "baseline_text": "전투 중에 잡담하면 안 돼∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "戦闘中のおしゃべりはダメだぞ！", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:8b5c62e29ffe27b1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1150, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "fa80f2c9f0aff2bdf35df168f0b181b82f2ff481f14ff984f154f1f3f157f18df7d12f2ff172f0c5f8e1f173f1edf0faf8b4f1abf8a3f0b1f0a481b8", "baseline_text": "잘 알아차렸구나∈//숨기고 있었는데…//흑발의 귀공자란 바로 나지∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よく気がついたな！//かくしていたんだけど……//黒髪の貴公子とは、俺のことさ∈", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:015c4a898c858567", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1227, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f55ef3a481b82f2ff0acf8b8f263f0e2f0a38143f0b5f3ee81432f2ff0acf0bff350f0ccf0f081b8", "baseline_text": "꺄핫∈//레니 말대로，오빠，//레벨업했네∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "キャハッ！//レニの言うとおり、お兄ちゃん、//レベルアップしてるね！", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:d4eab326a57709bf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1294, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f24cf24df0b6f7d12f2ff3b5f39bf8e1f14af24ef0f42f2ff4aff0aff951fa99f16ff0af8144", "baseline_text": "확실히…//농담의 수준도//높아진 것 같아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "確かに……//ジョークのレベルも//上がっているみたいだ。", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:0d5acb49d4e3d750", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1349, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f15af7d1f0aff0b881432f2ff3b5f39bf8b2f0aff0b8f0a8f7d1", "baseline_text": "어…아니，//농담이 아니라…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え……いや、//ジョークじゃなくて……", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:3d88d13c796028b2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1386, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0af81608143f3cff466f1f3f0cf81b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f25af96bf3e9f15af1472f2ff35ff944f0aff174f291f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "아～，재밌었다∈//아이리스，너무 웃어서//배가 아파졌어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あ～、おもしろかった！//アイリス、笑いすぎて//おなかいたくなっちゃった∈", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:1a7a4d8b200d5b54", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2258, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0b1f0f481432f2ff0b5f4c1f1d4f8b9f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a81442f2ff0d8f2ca8143f1f7f2d6f8a3f0d0f0aff2ecf0f18144", "baseline_text": "…나도，//오랜만에 즐거웠어．//그럼，전투로 돌아갈게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……ボクも、//ひさしぶりに楽しめた。//では、戦闘に戻る。", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:281f7db42bb4797d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1516, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f14ff0cff1b28143f0acf0b881b82f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0b5f3ee81432f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf8f4f2ecf0f181b8", "baseline_text": "아，기다려，레니∈//그럼，오빠，//아이리스도 갈게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あ、待ってよ、レニ！//じゃあ、お兄ちゃん、//アイリスもいくね！", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:1465894f30cc020a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1579, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f9bcf8cff25af16bf14bf7d1", "baseline_text": "둘 다 너무해…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "二人ともひどいよ……", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:5d1f122778980962", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1600, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f9bcf0cf81432f2ff1f7fad6f140f8b9f14af8cff3e0f9c7f991f1fbf0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "둘 다，//전투 중에 수다 떨면 안 된다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "二人とも、//戦闘中のおしゃべりはダメだぞ！", "pointer_offset": 824, "unit": "dialogue:f9145b79c351e046", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1643, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f15af297f0b1f7d12f2ff0b2fa62f151f0a4f9a9f1c7f0f4f7d1", "baseline_text": "어머나…//이런 진지한 면도…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あらら……//こういうマジメなとこも……", "pointer_offset": 828, "unit": "dialogue:e844e6d8b4a1e7fd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1682, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0acf0bff3502f2ff9a9fa99f16ff0f08144", "baseline_text": "…레벨업//한 것 같네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……レベルアップ//しているようだね。", "pointer_offset": 832, "unit": "dialogue:4263a600dc607189", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1719, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f0acf0b8f7d12f2ff1bdf25ef8b2f3a1f0b1f984f0b1f1472f2ff0b5fbeef0b2f148f14ff0a5f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，레니…//싸움이 끝나고 나서//오빠 이야기하자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃ、レニ……//たたかいがおわってから//お兄ちゃんのことおはなししよ∈", "pointer_offset": 836, "unit": "dialogue:4c785e0a5070d0cc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1790, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f7d1f2c9f2e9f15a8144", "baseline_text": "…알았어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……わかった。", "pointer_offset": 840, "unit": "dialogue:63366a6f416a3106", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1805, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f18ef263f0b2f0a4f7d1f0acf0b8f261f0a42f2ff14af0cff8e7f3e0f0cff0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "정말이지…레니까지//수다를 떨다니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まったく……レニまで//おしゃべりするなんて……", "pointer_offset": 844, "unit": "dialogue:d80f4f3986879ddf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1852, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "8163816381638163", "baseline_text": "…………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "…………", "pointer_offset": 848, "unit": "dialogue:b5999fb8c439aedc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1861, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f15af0a88148f175f98ff16ff0a2f1c72f2ff1bef14ff947f0b5f3eef1442f2ff263f8c8f2e1f15afabaf296f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "어라？평소 같으면//여기서 오빠가//말을 걸어올 텐데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あれ？　いつもなら、//ここで、お兄ちゃんが//はなしかけてくるのに……", "pointer_offset": 852, "unit": "dialogue:f2565e63eb0b3e97", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2317, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff1f7fad6f140f8b9f2b2f39bf0a5f8a4f287f957f28a81432f2ff0e2f0e4f0a2f0a3f147f957f278f0af8144", "baseline_text": "하지만…//전투 중에 잡담하지 않는 건，//대장으로서는 옳아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも……//戦闘中の私語をしないのは、//隊長としては正しい。", "pointer_offset": 856, "unit": "dialogue:3e59344500d9bc94", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 1989, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf0f42f2ff949fbf3f0cff1b1f0f181b8", "baseline_text": "그렇구나…//그럼，아이리스도//입 꾹 다물게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そっか……//じゃ、アイリスも//お口にチャックする！", "pointer_offset": 860, "unit": "dialogue:066cc6f37c35bfc6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2040, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0d8f14381442f2ff0e2f0e4f8c8f0e3f0f2f0aff14781432f2ff484f19cf0fa8144", "baseline_text": "그래．//대장을 본받아서，//힘내자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうだね。//隊長を見習って、//がんばろう。", "pointer_offset": 864, "unit": "dialogue:50d11a4c96891582", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2083, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "8169f2b4f8bcf0acf0b8f0a3f0a981442f2ff99cf0adf2c3f0c881432f2ff2c9f0affa4ef28af144f7d1816a", "baseline_text": "（역시 레니로군．//내 마음을，//알아준 건가…）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "（さすがはレニだな。//　俺の気持ちを、//　わかってくれたか……）", "pointer_offset": 868, "unit": "dialogue:5cc139a49e5728e9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2148, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af81608143f1adf0aef0f42f2ff0a4f8a4f263f984f484f19cf0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "좋아～，우리도//지지 말고 힘내자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よ～し、アイリスたちも//負けずにがんばろう！", "pointer_offset": 872, "unit": "dialogue:4446729f32721778", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2193, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f3a8f7d12f2ff484f19cf0fa8144", "baseline_text": "응…//힘내자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん……//がんばろう。", "pointer_offset": 876, "unit": "dialogue:b63d8f094fcf1ce0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02014.SBN", "offset": 2216, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 880, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
